.7 minutes last season, and DARKO has 2.4 per 100. The base per-minute rate sits below last season, so I make a small raise.","sources":["https://youtu.be/3UGI05PDvrE?t=850","stats"]},{"field":"late_games_out","text":"He is on a 2-year deal, not a core young player, and frontcourt minutes could shift to Clowney and Minott late. I add a small 1 game.","sources":["https://youtu.be/3UGI05PDvrE?t=1628"]}]}],"base_sources":["espn","fanscout","fantasypros","fantrax","own-stat","yahoo"]}